                <pb facs="0704" n="610" sameAs="frus:frus1945Malta/pg610"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>No record of the substance of this meeting has been found. The information given
                    here as to the meeting and the participants is taken from the Log, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg553">p. 553</ref>, which
                    states that the discussions continued <pb facs="0705" n="611" xml:id="pg611"/>
                    until 4 p. m. On August 13, 1954, Matthews wrote of this meeting as follows: “I do not recall the
                    subject but most such meetings were to inform the President of the results of
                    our morning Foreign Ministers meeting and to prepare him for the afternoon
                    agenda” (640.0029/8–1354).</p>
            </div>
        </body>
